Regarding the email retrieval logic, the system reads the email address from the Address field.

The checks are performed in the following order:

Reservation Level Check
First, the system checks whether an email address is available in the booking reservation.
<st119:EmailAddresses>
    <st119:EmailAddress id="10">
        <st119:Address>AZHABRI@GMAIL.COM</st119:Address>
        <st119:Comment>@E</st119:Comment>
    </st119:EmailAddress>
</st119:EmailAddresses>
Passenger Level Check
If the email address is not available at the reservation level, then the system checks under the passenger details.
<st119:Passenger>
    <st119:EmailAddress id="11">
        <st119:Address>AZHABRI@GMAIL.COM</st119:Address>
        <st119:Comment>@E</st119:Comment>
    </st119:EmailAddress>
</st119:Passenger>

Other than this, the system only checks for the Frequent Flyer Number and stores it if present.
If the email address is not found in both of the above checks, the email value will remain null and the check-in email notification will not be triggered.

